{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10421","headline":"遇冲和先生 · 高适","name":"遇冲和先生","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"冲和生何代，或谓游东溟。\n三命谒金殿，一言拜银青。\n自云多方术，往往通神灵。\n万乘亲问道，六宫无敢听。\n昔去限霄汉，今来覩仪形。\n头戴鶡鸟冠，手遥白鹤翎。\n终日饮醇酒，不醉复不醒。\n常忆鸡鸣山，每诵西昇经。\n拊背念离别，依然出户庭。\n莫见今如此，曾爲一客星。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"高适","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_10421.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10421","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}